Cleanest fix per my earlier plan: when dates change while step2 is shown, re-query availability and re-render the summary. The date change handlers (lines 181-209) currently: `if (self.state.step === 2) self.renderStep2();` — they re-render step2 BUT from the stale `a` snapshot. Fix: on date change in step 2, re-fetch availability for the new dates, update `state.selected` (need to re-match the same room type), and re-render.

